# 归档导出（GitHub Source code zip/tar.gz）只保留程序源码与升级日志。
# 仅影响归档导出；仓库网页与 raw 下载保留全部文件。
.gitattributes export-ignore
.gitignore export-ignore
LICENSE export-ignore
README.md export-ignore
README.en.md export-ignore
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md export-ignore
third_party_licenses/ export-ignore
pytest.ini export-ignore
requirements.txt export-ignore
requirements-dev.txt export-ignore
update.json export-ignore
screenshots/ export-ignore
tests/ export-ignore
